          "open_space_designation": "Local Open Spaces",
          "description": "The proposal will result in the temporary change of use of a small area of existing grassed open space within the grounds of Valence Library to accommodate a single-storey modular community building (approximately 58.3 -60 sqm). The development is temporary for a period of up to five years and will be installed on reversible pad foundations. The remainder of the open space will remain unaffected, and the site can be fully reinstated to its original condition following removal of the structure.",
